{"4404580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MOBU", "steam_appid": 4404580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/db87f0436c67e873b735ec4175af89f1.avif?t=1786111092\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a monk wielding superpowers in this fast-paced arena shooter with roguelite elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of bouncy enemies raining from the skies as the challenge escalates. Buy upgrades and special abilities to create game-breaking builds and push back the chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master attacks, special abilities, and precise movement in fast-paced arena combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/9a80bd3ca1cd2e5b8877a03f8ac05457.poster.avif?t=1786111092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/9a80bd3ca1cd2e5b8877a03f8ac05457.webm?t=1786111092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/9a80bd3ca1cd2e5b8877a03f8ac05457.mp4?t=1786111092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt to changing arena conditions and wave modifiers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/772247c2cf9dbaf1d6258aaba3944016.poster.avif?t=1786111092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/772247c2cf9dbaf1d6258aaba3944016.webm?t=1786111092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/772247c2cf9dbaf1d6258aaba3944016.mp4?t=1786111092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose from powerful upgrades between waves and create game-breaking builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/d71c589eea2d595e8e54016ae88f4cc5.poster.avif?t=1786111092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/d71c589eea2d595e8e54016ae88f4cc5.webm?t=1786111092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/d71c589eea2d595e8e54016ae88f4cc5.mp4?t=1786111092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as unique monks with distinct starting abilities and playstyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/8486d26f0d97eaff837355aa8d5b4097.poster.avif?t=1786111092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/8486d26f0d97eaff837355aa8d5b4097.webm?t=1786111092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/8486d26f0d97eaff837355aa8d5b4097.mp4?t=1786111092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-based combat</strong><br>Direct your attacks and special abilities with precision. Timing matters, and auto-attack is optional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies raining from the sky</strong><br>Survive escalating waves of bouncing enemies that  flood the arena with chaotic patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced runs under 30 minutes</strong>  <br>Perfect for quick sessions or “just one more try”.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build-defining upgrades between waves</strong><br>Choose from powerful upgrades and craft synergies that can break the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct playable characters</strong><br>Each monk starts with unique abilities and encourages a different playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging boss encounters</strong><br>Face dangerous bosses that demand precision and smart positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable content and higher difficulties</strong><br>Earn new characters, upgrades, and increasingly challenging levels as you improve.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404580/extras/db87f0436c67e873b735ec4175af89f1.avif?t=1786111092\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a monk wielding superpowers in this fast-paced arena shooter with roguelite elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of bouncy enemies raining from the skies as the challenge escalates. Buy upgrades and special abilities to create game-breaking builds and push back the chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master attacks, special abilities, and precise movement in fast-paced arena combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"